fix(dashboard,generate): release write lock before I/O; bail on invalid --server-url usage
scale: ~137 lines across 3 files [M]

- `crates/vox-dashboard/src/api/settings.rs`: Modified `put_settings` to clone the updated settings map and release the `RwLock` write guard before performing asynchronous file I/O (writing to disk), preventing serialization of concurrent PUT requests on disk latency.
- `crates/vox-cli/src/commands/generate.rs`: Changed the behavior when `--server-url` is provided without `--legacy-direct` from a silent warning to an `anyhow::bail!` error, ensuring misconfigurations fail loudly.
- `docs/src/feed.xml`: Updated the generated RSS feed.

